WEBVTT

00:00:58.639 --> 00:01:00.976
va ehtiyotkor o’ynashni
buyurishgan edilar.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:04.652
Gap shundaki, o'zi bir haftagina oldin,
men Emining qo'lini

00:01:04.676 --> 00:01:05.976
sindirib qo'ygan edim...

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.937
(Kulgi)

00:01:09.950 --> 00:01:11.100
(Kulgining tugashi)

00:01:11.124 --> 00:01:15.784
qahramoncha uni, rostakam bo’lmagan
snayper o’qidan, itarib yuborgan edim.

00:01:15.808 --> 00:01:17.842
(Kulgi)

00:01:17.866 --> 00:01:21.949
U menga hatto rahmat degan edi,
men esa bor kuchim bilan harakat qildim

00:01:21.973 --> 00:01:23.569
u o’qni hatto ko’rmadi ham.

00:01:23.593 --> 00:01:25.934
Men o’zimni yaxshi tutishga
harakat qilar edim.

00:01:25.958 --> 00:01:27.308
Va men singlimning yuzida

00:01:27.332 --> 00:01:29.568
alam, og’riq va ajablanishni ko’rdim,

00:01:29.592 --> 00:01:32.276
u yig’lashga tayyor turgan edi va buni